WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:03,270
Stop to rest and eat

2
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:12,440
It’s been seven days and we’re only halfway there

3
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,760
This convoy is really moving like crazy

4
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:30,500
What does this girl always hate me for?

5
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:33,570
May I ask if I have any sins against you?

6
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:38,380
Were you talking just now?

7
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:41,770
not me

8
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:44,880
It was you who spoke

9
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:48,620
Excuse me girl

10
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:51,360
Are you dissatisfied with me in any way?

11
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:55,100
I've probably never seen you girl, right?
